WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.472 --> 00:00:04.994
Roxy quickly changed into Rocket Girl.

2
00:00:05.014 --> 00:00:08.917
She ran out of the school and shot up into the air.

3
00:00:08.937 --> 00:00:17.345
"Look!" said Mara.

4
00:00:34.348 --> 00:00:34.788
"It's Rocket Girl!"

5
00:00:34.808 --> 00:00:36.670
"I wonder where she's going," said Jack.

6
00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:41.273
"Roxy's still not back from the restroom," said Terrell.

7
00:00:41.293 --> 00:00:43.855
"What's taking her so long?"

8
00:00:48.738 --> 00:00:52.781
When Roxy arrived at True Savings Bank, she expected to find the bank robber.

9
00:00:54.002 --> 00:00:55.803
Instead she saw a crowd of people.

10
00:00:56.744 --> 00:00:57.985
And they were all frozen!

11
00:00:58.005 --> 00:01:01.287
"Whoa! What happened here?"

12
00:01:01.707 --> 00:01:02.428
Roxy wondered.

13
00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:06.061
"Why are all these people frozen?"

14
00:01:08.001 --> 00:01:09.722
Detective Smith rushed into the bank.

15
00:01:11.002 --> 00:01:12.262
He was out of breath from running.

16
00:01:13.623 --> 00:01:15.963
"Rocket Girl," he said.

17
00:01:15.983 --> 00:01:18.524
"I came as fast as I could.

18
00:01:19.524 --> 00:01:21.885
I was at the Dairy Dream Ice Cream Parlor."

19
00:01:21.905 --> 00:01:26.386
"You know, Detective, you really shouldn't eat ice cream for breakfast!"

20
00:01:26.866 --> 00:01:27.646
Roxy laughed.

21
00:01:28.987 --> 00:01:30.227
Detective Smith frowned.

22
00:01:30.247 --> 00:01:34.424
"I wasn't eating ice cream for breakfast," he said.

23
00:01:34.444 --> 00:01:36.625
"The ice cream was stolen.

24
00:01:37.726 --> 00:01:39.427
So we have two robberies to solve."

25
00:01:40.928 --> 00:01:42.549
"Hmm," thought Roxy.

26
00:01:43.429 --> 00:01:44.790
Dairy Dream had been robbed.

27
00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:47.391
And there were frozen people at the bank.

28
00:01:48.592 --> 00:01:50.353
Roxy found this very suspicious.

29
00:01:50.373 --> 00:01:55.916
"I think both robberies were done by the same person," said Roxy.

30
00:01:55.936 --> 00:01:58.237
"Why do you think that?"

31
00:01:58.597 --> 00:01:59.518
asked Detective Smith.

32
00:01:59.538 --> 00:02:04.764
"We have stolen ice cream and frozen people," said Roxy.

33
00:02:04.784 --> 00:02:07.386
"The crimes must be connected."

34
00:02:07.406 --> 00:02:11.508
"I don't think so," said Detective Smith.

35
00:02:11.528 --> 00:02:15.710
"Bank robbers don't usually rob ice cream parlors."

36
00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:21.274
"Well, we have to unfreeze these people right away," said Roxy.

37
00:02:21.294 --> 00:02:24.055
"I'll use my heat vision."

38
00:02:24.075 --> 00:02:25.836
"Heat vision?"

39
00:02:26.216 --> 00:02:27.157
said Detective Smith.

40
00:02:27.177 --> 00:02:29.838
"I thought your eyes shot lasers."

41
00:02:30.699 --> 00:02:32.840
"They do that too," said Roxy.

42
00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:36.021
"You'd better stand back, Detective."

43
00:02:38.283 --> 00:02:40.384
Roxy stared hard at one of the frozen people.

44
00:02:41.365 --> 00:02:45.088
An orange beam slowly radiated out of Roxy's eyes, melting the ice.

45
00:02:49.110 --> 00:02:50.952
She melted one ice block after another.

46
00:02:52.913 --> 00:02:54.534
Soon all the people were free.

47
00:02:54.554 --> 00:02:59.537
"Brr! Thank you, Rocket Girl," said a woman.

48
00:02:59.557 --> 00:03:02.079
"Can you tell us what happened here?"

49
00:03:02.499 --> 00:03:03.120
asked Roxy.

50
00:03:03.948 --> 00:03:04.829
The woman shivered.

51
00:03:04.849 --> 00:03:09.273
"I came in to deposit a check," she said.

52
00:03:09.293 --> 00:03:14.157
"Then a man came in and started blasting freeze rays at everyone.

53
00:03:14.177 --> 00:03:17.279
Brr!" "Freeze rays?"

54
00:03:17.699 --> 00:03:18.360
said Roxy.

55
00:03:19.321 --> 00:03:21.363
Just then Detective Smith's phone rang.

56
00:03:21.383 --> 00:03:24.625
"Hello?" he said.

57
00:03:25.226 --> 00:03:27.087
Detective Smith looked very serious.

58
00:03:28.108 --> 00:03:29.509
"Really? How long ago?

59
00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:31.371
Oh no!

60
00:03:31.791 --> 00:03:32.552
This is terrible.

61
00:03:33.816 --> 00:03:34.217
Yes, sir.

62
00:03:34.537 --> 00:03:35.278
Right away, sir."

63
00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:38.721
"What's wrong now?"

64
00:03:39.121 --> 00:03:41.284
asked Roxy after Detective Smith had hung up.

65
00:03:41.304 --> 00:03:44.467
"Another bank is being robbed!"

66
00:03:44.847 --> 00:03:45.528
said the detective.
